{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, a sealed domain was crafted for warriors to battle endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In search of a way to prolong your master's life, you venture into this unknown realm. But to leave, you must face those who came before you.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a series of unique opponents in intense fast-paced duels. Each boss brings their own distinct abilities and attacks for you to overcome.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.poster.avif?t=1752392515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.webm?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.mp4?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deflect, dodge, or even use your own attacks to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All abilities are available right from the start\u00a0\u2014 your success depends only on how you use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.poster.avif?t=1752392515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.webm?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.mp4?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Hidden Truths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every boss has a story. Learn as much\u00a0\u2014 or as little\u00a0\u2014 as you choose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.poster.avif?t=1752392515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.webm?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.mp4?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a realm where death can be endlessly deferred, some defeated foes may return in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.poster.avif?t=1752392515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.webm?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.mp4?t=1752392515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linear storyline with fast-paced action combat duels against multiple bosses.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamlessly blend offense and defense with dodges, parries, and counter-attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All abilities are available from the start for you to play with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional character stories and interactions enrich the world without interrupting gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692670?t=1752392515","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/9f4397ff6194290179ebbe3f58a27dfdc2cbef67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752392515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/257a9c84b738eaa52efcb53bed85a49d53a3f844/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752392515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/257a9c84b738eaa52efcb53bed85a49d53a3f844/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752392515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains animated violence and revealing outfits. Some suggestive themes, but no explicit sexual content is present."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, a sealed domain was crafted for warriors to battle endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In search of a way to prolong your master's life, you venture into this unknown realm. But to leave, you must face those who came before you.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a series of unique opponents in intense fast-paced duels. Each boss brings their own distinct abilities and attacks for you to overcome.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid